  "rust_summary": "client Host services, GUI painting, model-head snapshots and client lifecycle notifications.",
  "doc_summary": "Client-only Host snapshots of the window, connection, entities, interpolated model heads and profile skins; visual rays and block occlusion facts; atlas GUI painting, nine-slice widgets and tooltips; persisted mod key changes and a local action bar. client_start runs before connecting (a window need not exist yet), client_disconnecting before a real connection is discarded (not dimension travel), client_stopping once before final save/exit. menu_background can change a normal menu blur request (None disables it; finite 1..64 only). Bundles need \"hooks\": @API:client_services@."
